## **Section 4: Identity, Accounts, and Access**

**[CONCERN]  ****Staff account offboarding process informal**  F4-003   ● Significant investment

Staff offboarding happens informally. Informal processes are prone to missed steps — a forgotten account means a former employee retains access.

| **Recommended actions:** **⚠  **Formalize the staff offboarding process as a documented checklist.*  [Within 30 days  ⚠ Budget constraint]* |
| --- |

**[CONCERN]  ****MFA not enabled on all privileged accounts**  F4-005   ● Staff time only

MFA is enabled on some privileged accounts but not all. Any privileged account without MFA represents a full compromise risk.

| **Recommended actions:** **→  **Enable MFA on all remaining privileged accounts.*  [Within 30 days]* **→  **Audit all privileged accounts and confirm MFA status.*  [Within 30 days]* |
| --- |

**[WATCH]  ****Staff account onboarding process informal**  F4-002   ● Significant investment

Staff onboarding happens informally. This works until a step is missed or the person who knows the process is unavailable.

| **Recommended actions:** **⚠  **Formalize the staff onboarding process as a documented checklist.*  [Within 90 days  ⚠ Budget constraint]* |
| --- |

**[WATCH]  ****Student account lifecycle handled informally**  F4-004   ● Staff time only

Student account lifecycle is handled informally. This creates risk around departing students retaining access.

| **Recommended actions:** **→  **Document the student account lifecycle process.*  [Within 90 days]* |
| --- |

**[WATCH]  ****Shared accounts exist but are not formally reviewed**  F4-007   ● Staff time only

Some shared accounts exist. The exposure is unclear because these accounts have not been formally reviewed.

| **Recommended actions:** **→  **Inventory all shared accounts and document their purpose.*  [Within 90 days]* |
| --- |

**[WATCH]  ****Password reset procedures partially documented**  F4-008   ● Staff time only

Password reset procedures exist for some platforms but not all.

| **Recommended actions:** **→  **Complete password reset documentation for all major platforms.*  [Within 90 days]* |
| --- |

